s guy?) is back, aloof as ever. This time he's told to watch his meters to watch for water consumption. I loved all the little signs he had up lol..","reviewtitle":"Well have you?","reviewer":"Spuzz","reviewdate":"2008-04-18 01:08:08","createdate":"2008-04-18 01:08:08","stars":"4"},{"reviewbody":"This is ahead of its time in terms of humor. Or maybe the British were just ahead of us in terms of humor in general? Who is \"us\"? What country am I from? Where do I currently live? I don't know.","reviewtitle":"Epic win","reviewer":"The_Emperor_Of_Television","reviewdate":"2012-03-27 09:31:49","createdate":"2012-03-27 09:31:49","stars":"5"},{"reviewbody":"Britain was already deep into socialism.  Part of that is very expensive energy (I guess so some can get it for free - but it's never you for some reason). ","reviewtitle":"...or go broke","reviewer":"JayKay49","reviewer_itemname":"@jaykay49","reviewdate":"2019-03-23 06:58:11","createdate":"2019-03-23 06:58:11","stars":"0"}],"server":"dn600308.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn600308":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5454037823"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-20 14:39:59.381953"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1108336785,"workable_servers":["dn600308.us.archive.org"]}